# Execution safety

- Work in small, testable increments. Do not deploy, push, add paid services, or create credentials without current user approval.
- On the first failed verification, diagnose; on the second, try one materially different correction; on the third consecutive failure for the same work item, stop and report it rather than retrying.
- Treat financial outputs as simulations, never financial, tax, investment, or legal advice.
